### Create Department IT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Information Technology",
  "code": "IT"
}

###

### Create Department CSE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Computer Science",
  "code": "CSE"
}

###

### List departments (note their ids)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/departments

###

### Create Student 1 (with department id 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rudra Mishra",
  "email": "rudra@gmail.com",
  "rollNo": "IT102",
  "cgpa": 8.0,
  "department": { "id": 1 }
}

###

### Create Student 2 (with department id 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Singh",
  "email": "priya@gmail.com",
  "rollNo": "IT103",
  "cgpa": 8.5,
  "department": { "id": 1 }
}

###

### Create Student 3 (with department id 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amit Kumar",
  "email": "amit@gmail.com",
  "rollNo": "CS104",
  "cgpa": 7.9,
  "department": { "id": 2 }
}

###

### List all students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students

###

### Get Student by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/1

###

### Update Student (allot / change department)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rudra Mishra",
  "email": "rudra@gmail.com",
  "rollNo": "IT102",
  "cgpa": 9.0,
  "department": { "id": 2 }
}

###

### Verify Updated Student
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/1

###

### Delete Student
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/1
